my favorite pictured about to stuff my face ."},{"business_id":"kh5gB31SUBeV_rxoOF-2jg","review_id":"F3aA3tgKj5hRPFhBZlou4g","date":"2021-04-05T03:19:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9325979351997375,"text_excerpt":"Really delicious pizza! I am originally from NYC and was impressed with how good this was. I tried the pepperoni at their pop up at Zony Mash Beer and I am excited to go back to have it again soon! Definitely try a slice or pre-order a pie! P.s. my pup also loved the pepperoni"},{"business_id":"kh5gB31SUBeV_rxoOF-2jg","review_id":"9H03QTfoRLFZ7RII-O_sMg","date":"2021-10-20T11:11:57","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9194604754447937,"text_excerpt":"The only thing I can complain about after my first Zee's pizza is that they are only open 2 days a week! The pizza was incredible. We got the pepperoni pizza with mikes hot honey and jalapeños on the side. The pizza was perfect. Even though the slices were large and covered in pepperoni it was not soggy, mushy, or overly greasy. Each but had a nice crunch and perfect amount of toppings. My husband and I were shocked when we realized we ate the whole thing! I highly recommend Zee's. And cannot wait to get a pizza from them again!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"kh5gB31SUBeV_rxoOF-2jg","photo_id":"6Jsz05oxWJB027wzoS03FQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/6Jsz05oxWJB027wzoS03FQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9471550583839417},{"business_id":"kh5gB31SUBeV_rxoOF-2jg","photo_id":"-U9ZB7d1oNfA9JtzxwygbA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/-U9ZB7d1oNfA9JtzxwygbA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9456489682197571},{"business_id":"kh5gB31SUBeV_rxoOF-2jg","photo_id":"0303_YwbCYCO34khE1henQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/0303_YwbCYCO34khE1henQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9189324975013733},{"business_id":"kh5gB31SUBeV_rxoOF-2jg","photo_id":"ZEUIogU2NuAGp-J9cz5CnA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ZEUIogU2NuAGp-J9cz5CnA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8066114783287048}]},"notebook_case":